or=#00E1FFFF>Knights</color> are doing?","nextNodeIds":[3090204]},{"nodeId":3090204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3490726843,"text":"But if you got anything more interesting to do, Paimon can come too!","nextNodeIds":[3090205]},{"nodeId":3090205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1046250163,"text":"Like... going on a shopping spree... or checking out the <color=#00E1FFFF>Statue of The Seven</color> again.","nextNodeIds":[3090206]},{"nodeId":3090206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1623923515,"text":"At the temples of The Four Winds, we found something like... solidified wind, didn't we?","nextNodeIds":[3090207]},{"nodeId":3090207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":431444787,"text":"In Mondstadt, people call them \"Anemoculi.\"","nextNodeIds":[3090208]},{"nodeId":3090208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2552201755,"text":"They're called this because they can be fitted into the statue's eyes.","nextNodeIds":[3090209]},{"nodeId":3090209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":536131059,"text":"Some fairy tales say the statues' eyes originally had gems that were taken by swallows.","nextNodeIds":[3090210]},{"nodeId":3090210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2863282419,"text":"But Anemoculi never had a physical form from the start.","nextNodeIds":[3090212]},{"nodeId":3090212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3004973211,"text":"People with Visions collect them to offer to the <color=#00E1FFFF>statues</color> in exchange for blessings.","nextNodeIds":[3090213]},{"nodeId":3090213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":387798371,"text":"Unlike others with powers, you don't have a Vision. But then the rules of this world don't apply to you anyway so...","nextNodeIds":[3090214]},{"nodeId":3090214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2237505467,"text":"We can go see what happens right now, if you wanna try!","nextNodeIds":[3090215]},{"nodeId":3090215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1202691819,"text":"The statue in Windrise should be the closest one.","nextNodeIds":[3090216]},{"nodeId":3090216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1221906051,"text":"Paimon can't wait to see what the gods do to you!","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":30904,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["31101","2",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["46904","3",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":30904,"initDialog":3090401,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1005],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/AQ/Mengde1_309/Q30904","priority":5,"questId":311,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":3090201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1924324531,"text":"Phew, it's finally done.","nextNodeIds":[3090202]},{"nodeId":3090402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":876425227,"text":"Well, all that \"ley flow\" and \"elemental lines\" stuff Lisa was going on about should hopefully be back to normal.","nextNodeIds":[3090403]},{"nodeId":3090403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3188057339,"text":"Wanna go back and see how the <color=#00E1FFFF>Knights</color> are doing?","nextNodeIds":[3090404]},{"nodeId":3090404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3714447067,"text":"But if you got anything more interesting to do, Paimon can come too!","nextNodeIds":[3090405]},{"nodeId":3090405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3897991803,"text":"By the way, we obtained another Anemoculus in one of The Four Winds' temples, right?","nextNodeIds":[3090406]},{"nodeId":3090406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2121738699,"text":"We might come across more of them in the future, so don't forget to offer them to the Statues!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[30902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[30904,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1005"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINL